entries[246055] = { ["name"] = "Inquisition Grips", ["text"] = "Sanctified\nBinds when picked up\nHands Plate\n681 Armor\n+13 Stamina\n+38 Intellect\nDurability 55 / 55\nClasses: Paladin\nRequires Level 60\nEquip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%.\n\nEquip: Reduces the chance for your attacks to be dodged or parried by 1%.\n\nEquip: Increases your attack speed by 2%.\n\nInquisition Shockplate (0/8)\nInquisition Faceguard\nInquisition Epaulets\nInquisition Cuirass\nInquisition Cord\nInquisition Plate Pants\nInquisition Stompers\nInquisition Armbraces\nInquisition Grips\n(2) Set : While Shock and Awe is active, Crusader Strike and Exorcism grant you Holy Power, increasing all Holy damage you deal by 10%, stacking up to 3 times. (100ms cooldown)\n(4) Set : Divine Storm, Holy Shock, and Holy Wrath consume all your Holy Power, dealing 100% increased damage per Holy Power you have accumulated, 50% effective against player controlled targets.\n(6) Set : Consuming Holy Power increases your Spell Power by 8 to 18% per Holy Power consumed for 10 sec.\nSell Price:" }
